Package: ipq-wifi-buffalo_wxr-5950ax12
Submenu: ath10k Board-Specific Overrides
Version: 2023-11-10-0c2e810e71ed0a59fb00246c7fa2c236ff67a0ee-1
Depends: +libc @(TARGET_ipq40xx||TARGET_ipq806x||TARGET_ipq807x)
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: firmware
Category: Firmware
Title: board-2.bin Overrides for Buffalo WXR-5950AX12
Maintainer: 
Source: ipq-wifi-2023-11-10-0c2e810e71ed0a59fb00246c7fa2c236ff67a0ee.tar.xz
Type: ipkg
Description: The Buffalo WXR-5950AX12 requires board-specific, reference ("cal") data
that is not yet present in the upstream wireless firmware distribution.

This package supplies board-2.bin file(s) that, in the interim,
overwrite those supplied by the ath10k-firmware-* packages.

This is package is only necessary for the Buffalo WXR-5950AX12.

Do not install it for any other device!

@@

