Source-Makefile: package/libs/libselinux/Makefile
Build-Depends/host: libsepol/host musl-fts/host pcre2/host
Build-Types: host

Package: libselinux
Version: 3.5-1
Depends: +libc +libsepol +libpcre2 +USE_MUSL:musl-fts
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: libs
Category: Libraries
Repository: base
Title: Runtime SELinux library
Maintainer: Thomas Petazzoni <thomas.petazzoni@bootlin.com>
Source: libselinux-3.5.tar.gz
License: libselinux-1.0
LicenseFiles: LICENSE
CPE-ID: cpe:/a:selinuxproject:libselinux
Type: ipkg
Description: 	libselinux is the runtime SELinux library that provides
	interfaces (e.g. library functions for the SELinux kernel
	APIs like getcon(), other support functions like
	getseuserbyname()) to SELinux-aware applications. libselinux
	may use the shared libsepol to manipulate the binary policy
	if necessary (e.g. to downgrade the policy format to an
	older version supported by the kernel) when loading policy.
http://selinuxproject.org/page/Main_Page
Thomas Petazzoni <thomas.petazzoni@bootlin.com>
@@

