Description:    Provides Web UI (found under System/Advanced Reboot) to reboot supported Linksys and ZyXEL routers to an alternative partition. Also provides Web UI to shut down (power off) your device. Supported dual-partition routers are listed at https://docs.openwrt.melmac.net/luci-app-advanced-reboot/
https://docs.openwrt.melmac.net/luci-app-advanced-reboot/
OpenWrt LuCI community
