License: FTL GPL-2.0-only MIT ZLIB GPL-3.0-or-later
LicenseFiles: docs/LICENSE.TXT docs/FTL.TXT docs/GPLv2.TXT src/bdf/README src/pcf/README src/gzip/zlib.h builds/unix/config.sub builds/unix/config.guess builds/unix/libtool 
