Source: pkgconf-1.8.0.tar.xz
License: MIT
LicenseFiles: COPYING
Type: ipkg
Description:   pkgconf is a program which helps to configure compiler and linker flags
  for development frameworks. It is similar to pkg-config from
  freedesktop.org, providing additional functionality while also
  maintaining compatibility.
http://pkgconf.org/
Rosen Penev <rosenp@gmail.com>
@@


