Maintainer: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Source: rtpmidid-2022-07-07.tar.gz
License: GPL-3.0-or-later LGPL-2.1-or-later
LicenseFiles: LICENSE.md LICENSE-lib.txt LICENSE-daemon.txt
Type: ipkg
Description: rtpmidid is an user daemon, and when a RTP MIDI device is announced
using mDNS (also known as Zeroconf, Avahi, and multicast DNS) it
exposes this ALSA sequencer port.
https://github.com/davidmoreno/rtpmidid/
Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
@@


