Package: scapy
Version: 2.5.0-1
Depends: +libc +python3
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: net
Category: Network
Repository: packages
Title: Interactive packet manipulation tool and network scanner
Maintainer: W. Michael Petullo <mike@flyn.org>
Source: scapy-2.5.0.tar.gz
License: GPL-2.0-only
LicenseFiles: LICENSE
Type: ipkg
Description:   Scapy is a powerful interactive packet manipulation program built on top
  of the Python interpreter. It can be used to forge or decode packets of
  a wide number of protocols, send them over the wire, capture them, match
  requests and replies, and much more.
https://scapy.net/
W. Michael Petullo <mike@flyn.org>
@@

Package: scapy-src
Version: 2.5.0-1
Depends: +libc 
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: 
Section: net
Category: Network
Repository: packages
Title: Interactive packet manipulation tool and network scanner (sources)
Maintainer: W. Michael Petullo <mike@flyn.org>
Source: scapy-2.5.0.tar.gz
License: GPL-2.0-only
LicenseFiles: LICENSE
Type: ipkg
Description:       Scapy is a powerful interactive packet manipulation program built on top
  of the Python interpreter. It can be used to forge or decode packets of
  a wide number of protocols, send them over the wire, capture them, match
  requests and replies, and much more.

    This package contains the Python source files for scapy.
https://scapy.net/
W. Michael Petullo <mike@flyn.org>
@@
