Package: snort
Menu: 1
Submenu: Firewall
Version: 2.9.19-2
Depends: +libc +libdaq +libdnet +libnghttp2 +libopenssl +libpcap +libpcre +libpthread +libtirpc +libuuid +zlib +luajit +SNORT_LZMA:liblzma
