Source: freeswitch-1.10.11.-release.tar.xz
License: AGPL-3.0 Apache-2.0 BSD-2-Clause BSD-3-Clause BSD-4-Clause BSD-like Beerware GPL-1.0+ GPL-2.0 GPL-2.0+ GPL-3.0 ISC LGPL-2.0+ LGPL-2.1 LGPL-2.1+ MIT/X11 (BSD like) MPL-1.1 OpenLDAP RSA-MD zlib-acknowledgement
