Config:
	config SIPROXD_MAX_CLIENTS
		int "Max supported clients"
		default 32
		depends on PACKAGE_siproxd
		help
		  Default 32 is sufficient for home environments. Larger values
		  consume more memory (e.g. RSS of 17 MB with upstream default 512).
